      "side": 1,
      "message": "Overall looks good! I added small suggestions regarding catching a corner case (failing `iommu_dma_init_domain()`) and slight update to the commit message to try to clarify the \u0027non-DMA-API domain\u0027 and that supporting a device\u0027s dma_map_ops is out of scope.\n\nAnd a suggestion for catching the corner case of `iommu_dma_init_domain()` failing as it was easy.\n\nFeel free to ignore.",
      "revId": "7e1c157e87d3f4d0d745cb4b1f23673bad947d99",
